<title>NETHERLANDS: Aegon appoints new Scottish Equitable head.</title>
<headline>Aegon appoints new Scottish Equitable head.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch insurer Aegon said on Thursday that David Henderson, 52, had been appointed chief executive at its Scottish Equitable Plc unit, succeeding the late David Berridge who died last week.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
